# Keeps the Kotlin source root in the repository.
#
# Git does not track empty directories, and the seed branch deliberately carries no
# lesson code — without this file a fresh clone would have no src/main/kotlin at all.
# Lessons go in chNN/ packages beside it, on a chapter branch:
#
#     project/src/main/kotlin/ch02/Booleans.kt   package ch02   fun main()
#
# See docs/way-of-working.md.
